stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Requested
    Requested --> Assessed: profile assessed
    Assessed --> Approved: accountable approval
    Assessed --> Retired: request declined
    Approved --> Provisioning: desired state accepted
    Provisioning --> Validating: providers ready
    Provisioning --> Provisioning: retry or resume
    Validating --> Active: readiness evidence accepted
    Validating --> Provisioning: remediation required

    Active --> Restricted: partial containment
    Restricted --> Active: restriction cleared
    Active --> Suspended: service suspended
    Restricted --> Suspended: full suspension
    Suspended --> Validating: reactivation approved

    Active --> Migrating: placement change approved
    Restricted --> Migrating: controlled migration
    Migrating --> Validating: target cutover complete
    Migrating --> Active: rollback to source

    Active --> Offboarding: termination effective
    Restricted --> Offboarding: termination effective
    Suspended --> Offboarding: closure approved
    Offboarding --> Retained: hold or retention applies
    Offboarding --> Retired: obligations complete
    Retained --> Retired: disposition complete
    Retired --> [*]

    note right of Provisioning
        Idempotent provider commands
        Desired-state reconciliation
    end note

    note right of Validating
        Isolation, identity, placement,
        recovery, quota, and operations
    end note

    note right of Offboarding
        Revoke, export, reconcile,
        retain, erase, and evidence
    end note
